    {
      "text": "CTCAC CA-22-425: The project, 2350 S. Bascom, located at 2350 S. Bascom Avenue in San Jose, requested and is being recommended for a reservation of $3,218,752 in annual federal tax credits and $18,680,000 in total state tax credits to finance the new construction of 122 units of housing serving large families with rents affordable to households earning 30%-80% of area median income (AMI).",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001619"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City of San Jose permit H21-004 (Site Development Permit/Amendment, folder year 2021), status Approved, issue date 2022-02-04: \"SB 35 Ministerial Site Development Permit to allow the demolition of two commercial buildings totaling 7,155 sf and the construction of 6 story mixed-use, multifamily unit project consisting of 123 100% affordable rental units and 1,437 square feet of gro\" (city text cut off at 255 characters)",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001956"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Operating name 23 Fifty Bascom, managed by Buckingham Property Management. Directory listing shows 123 units, 122 affordable, studio to three-bedroom, with rent tiers at 30%, 50%, 60% and 80% AMI; waitlists closed for all unit types.",
